## The Dataset

All data is **synthetic** (generated by code), but designed to be statistically realistic:

| File | Rows | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `stock_prices.csv` | 10,430 | Daily open, high, low, close, volume |
| `financials.csv` | 160 | Quarterly revenue, net income, EPS, R&D spend |
| `company_metadata.csv` | 10 | Sector, market cap, country, founded year |

**Companies (fictional):**

| Ticker | Company | Sector |
|--------|---------|--------|
| ALPH | Alphatech Inc. | Technology |
| JVNT | Jovent Cloud | Technology |
| BNKR | Banker Group | Finance |
| INVX | Invex Financial | Finance |
| CURA | Cura Health | Healthcare |
| HLTH | HealthPrime Co. | Healthcare |
| DRVE | DriveCo Motors | Consumer |
| FSTR | Fastretail Ltd. | Consumer |
| ENRX | Energix Corp. | Energy |
| GLBL | Global Logistics | Industrials |

The dataset includes a **simulated 2022 bear market** (June–December 2022) and realistic **Q4 seasonal patterns** for consumer companies.

